---
/* The scenic plate IS the section, not a picture inside it.

   Two versions preceded this and both were the same mistake in different
   clothes: an image sitting in a box on the left with copy beside it. A
   framed rectangle inside a section always reads as an illustration of the
   text. Letting the photograph BE the background and fading it out across the
   left half gives the copy clean, dark ground to sit on and gives the section
   somewhere to be — the same trick the hero uses, at a different scale.

   The plate is a peak above cloud at first light: scenic, calm, and carrying
   no clinical signal at all, which is the point. See
   public/assets/photos/CREDITS.md. */
---

<section class="manifesto" data-color-scheme="dark" aria-labelledby="manifesto-heading">
  <div class="manifesto__plate" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="container page-section manifesto__inner">
    <div class="manifesto__copy">
      <h2 id="manifesto-heading" class="manifesto__heading">Calm should be standard care.</h2>
      <p class="manifesto__body">
        Emergency rooms feel chaotic because nobody can see what is coming. Patients wait in the
        dark, and care teams meet every story cold. When the story arrives first, the waiting room
        finally makes sense to <em>both</em> of them.
      </p>
      <a class="manifesto__cta" href="/waitlist">Join the waitlist</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--slate-90);
    color: var(--color-text-base);
  }

  /* Full bleed, and masked so it dissolves across the left half rather than
     ending at an edge. Two masks multiplied: a horizontal ramp that clears the
     copy, and a vertical one so the plate does not butt against the sections
     above and below. */
  .manifesto__plate {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -1;
    background-image: image-set(url('/assets/photos/peak@1x.webp') 1x, url('/assets/photos/peak.webp') 2x);
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center 42%;
    -webkit-mask-image:
      linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 4%, rgb(0 0 0 / 0.35) 34%, #000 68%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, #000 18%, #000 82%, transparent 100%);
    mask-image:
      linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 4%, rgb(0 0 0 / 0.35) 34%, #000 68%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, #000 18%, #000 82%, transparent 100%);
    -webkit-mask-composite: source-in;
            mask-composite: intersect;
  }

  .manifesto__inner {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    min-block-size: 62vh;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .manifesto__copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-6x);
    max-inline-size: 44ch;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1080.02px) {
    .manifesto__copy { max-inline-size: 40ch; }
  }

  .manifesto__heading {
    font-size: var(--font-size-display-small);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    line-height: var(--line-height-display);
    letter-spacing: var(--letter-spacing-display);
    max-inline-size: 14ch;
  }
  .manifesto__body {
    font-size: var(--font-size-text-large);
    line-height: var(--line-height-open);
    color: rgb(from var(--white) r g b / 0.86);
  }
  .manifesto__body em { font-style: italic; color: var(--white); }

  .manifesto__cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: var(--space-3x) var(--space-6x);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    border: 1px solid rgb(from var(--white) r g b / 0.42);
    color: var(--white);
    font-size: var(--font-size-16);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    letter-spacing: normal;
    transition: background-color var(--motion-duration-base) var(--ease-ui);
  }
  .manifesto__cta:hover { background-color: rgb(from var(--white) r g b / 0.12); }

  /* The plate travels as the section crosses. It arrives oversized and settles,
     which is what stops a full-bleed photograph reading as wallpaper. */
  @keyframes manifesto-plate {
    from { scale: 1.18; background-position: center 30%; }
    to   { scale: 1.02; background-position: center 56%; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    @supports (animation-timeline: view()) {
      .manifesto__plate {
        animation: manifesto-plate linear both;
        animation-timeline: view();
        animation-range: cover 0% cover 100%;
      }
    }
    .manifesto__cta { transition: background-color var(--motion-duration-base) var(--ease-ui); }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .manifesto__cta { transition: none; } }
</style>
